le Res (Suppl)</source><year>1978</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>9</fpage><lpage>10</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="other">Kao, C.Y. 1989. Electrophysiological properties of uterine smooth  muscle. <italic>In</italic> Biology of the Uterus. R.M. Wynn and W.P. Jollie, editors. Plenum Press, New York. 403&#x02013;454.</citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="other">Kao, C.Y., and S.R. Levinson. 1986. Tetrodotoxin, Saxitoxin and  the Molecular Biology of the Sodium Channel. <italic>Ann. NY Acad. Sci.</italic>  Vol. 479. 52&#x02013;292.</citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kao</surname><given-names>CY</given-names></name><name><surname>McCullough</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ionic currents in the uterine smooth muscle</article-title><source>J Physiol (Camb)</source><year>1975</year><volume>246</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>36</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1133781</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kao</surname><given-names>CY</given-names></name><name><surname>Wakui</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>SY</given-names></name><name><surname>Yoshino</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The outward current of the isolated rat myometrium</article-title><source>J Physiol (Camb)</source><year>1989</year><volume>418</volume><fpage>20P</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kl&#x000f6;ckner</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Isenberg</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Calcium currents of cesium loaded isolated smooth muscle cells (urinary bladder of the guinea pig)</article-t